<h2 class="sj-h2">Youth &amp; Club Uniform FAQ</h2>
<div class="sj-faq">
<details>
<summary>Is there a minimum order for youth or club soccer uniforms?</summary>
<p>No. MOMUTO has no minimum order, so a small squad or a whole club can order custom uniforms with no minimum-quantity surcharge. Pricing per jersey drops as the order grows, but you're never forced to buy a fixed batch.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Do you make youth and kids sizes?</summary>
<p>Yes. MOMUTO offers youth and adult sizing, so the same design can be ordered across every age group in your club — from the youngest academy squads to senior teams. A full <a href="/pages/size-guide">size guide</a> with measurements is available before you order.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Can every player have a different size, name, and number?</summary>
<p>Yes. One team order can mix any sizes, and each player gets their own name and number at no extra cost. Because the uniforms are full dye-sublimation printed, personalization is part of the print, not an add-on.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Can a whole club order matching uniforms across different age groups?</summary>
<p>Yes. Clubs and academies regularly order one unified design across multiple teams and age groups in both youth and adult sizes. Your free design mockup can be shared with coaches and parents for approval before anything is produced.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>How long does delivery take for a team order?</summary>
<p>Custom soccer uniforms are delivered in 25&ndash;30 days worldwide (production plus shipping direct from the factory). Your free design mockup is ready in 1&ndash;2 days, and production doesn't start until you approve it, so plan team orders a few weeks before the season.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Can I add our club crest and a sponsor logo?</summary>
<p>Yes. Upload your club crest and any sponsor artwork and our design team places it on the uniform. Sublimation prints logos and crests into the fabric in full color, with no size limits and no peeling — and no embroidery surcharge.</p>
</details>
</div>
